{"severity":"error","file":"errors/actor_init_arity_2.march","start_line":10,"start_col":12,"end_line":10,"end_col":27,"message":"Actor `Plain` declares no `init` parameters, but `spawn(Plain, …)` supplies 1 argument.\nIts init is `init { … }`; to take a value at spawn time, declare the parameters: `init(config : Config) { … }`.","code":"actor_init_arity","fix":null,"labels":[{"file":"errors/actor_init_arity_2.march","start_line":5,"start_col":9,"end_line":5,"end_col":17,"message":"`Plain`'s `init` takes no parameters"}],"notes":[],"category":"ACTOR"}
